# Components

## Reuse before redesign (mandatory)

Before writing new markup for a page/feature:

1. **Search** `src/components/`, `src/components/ui/`, `src/app/_components/`, and nearby `_components/` for an existing piece that already does the job (button, field, card, table shell, dialog, empty state, page header, …).
2. **Reuse** that component as-is when it fits.
3. **Extend** it with optional props / variants / slots when the page needs a small difference — do **not** copy-paste and redesign a parallel version.
4. **Extract** only when the same UI appears (or will appear) in 2+ places and no shared component exists yet — then put it in the correct placement table below.

### Don't

- Rebuild buttons, inputs, cards, headers, dialogs, or layout chrome from scratch on each page while a shared/UI component already exists.
- Fork a component into `PageXFoo` / `PageYFoo` that differ only by copy, className, or one optional section — add a prop instead.
- Hand-roll primitives that shadcn/MUI (or project wrappers) already cover.

### Do

- Prefer composition: page = shared building blocks + thin route glue.
- Add props for labels, icons, density, `className`, children/slots, and optional sections.
- If a change would break other callers, extend with a new optional prop or a focused variant — keep one source of truth.

## Folder-per-component

- Every component: `<name>/index.tsx` (never flat `_components/foo.tsx`).
- Private children: `<name>/_components/<child>/index.tsx` (or nested folders).
- Named export `function ComponentName()` — no default (except Next route files).
- When Vitest is enabled: colocated `<name>.test.tsx` next to `index.tsx`.

## Size & responsibility

- One job per component. Prefer extract over grow.
- Soft cap ≈ **150 lines** for UI components; split earlier if it mixes fetch + form + layout + modal.
- Providers under `src/providers/*.tsx` stay thin (compose only) — heavy logic belongs in hooks/`lib`.
- shadcn `ui/*` primitives may stay flat and slightly denser (CLI-compatible).

## Placement

| Scope | Path |
|-------|------|
| One route only | `src/app/<route>/_components/<name>/` |
| Layout / homepage only | `src/app/_components/<name>/` |
| Shared across 2+ routes | `src/components/<name>/` |
| Shared forms | `src/components/forms/<name>/` |
| Route-only forms | `src/app/<route>/_components/forms/<name>/` |
| shadcn primitives | `src/components/ui/*` (flat) |
| i18n routes (when enabled) | Pages/layouts under `src/app/[locale]/…` — home samples still `src/app/_components/` |

Never park single-route UI in `src/components/`. When i18n is on, see `.cursor/rules/i18n.mdc`.
